<div class=WordSection1>

<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:center;
text-indent:35.45pt'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:14.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;color:maroon'>İhracat Sayılan
Satış ve Teslimler Hakkında Tebliğ (İhracat: 2005/2)<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

<p class=MsoNormal align=right style='margin-top:6.0pt;text-align:right;
text-indent:35.45pt'><b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><span
style='font-size:11.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'> </span></b><b
style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'> </span></i></b><i><span style='font-size:10.0pt;
mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-weight:bold'>Dış Ticaret
Müsteşarlığından:27.01.2005 tarihli, 25709 sayılı R.G.<o:p></o:p></span></i></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:6.0pt'><i style='mso-bidi-font-style:normal'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow;mso-bidi-font-weight:
bold'>Tasarruflu Yazılar<span style='mso-tab-count:1'>              </span></span></i><b><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;background:yellow;mso-highlight:yellow'><a
